# Theme Bridge: the opt-in panel and integration health. Shows what NMSh would configure; nothing outside the demo home is touched.
Output assets/readme/theme-bridge.gif

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Type "/theme-bridge"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down@2
Sleep 1s
Down@2
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 0.8s
Escape
Sleep 0.8s
Type "/integrations"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
